{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1111111111111111","type":"group","x":0,"y":0,"width":1660,"height":300,"label":"总览：存储技术到认证机制","color":"4"},
		{"id":"1111111111111112","type":"group","x":0,"y":380,"width":2060,"height":300,"label":"Session + Cookie SSO：同主域或配合重定向机制","color":"5"},
		{"id":"1111111111111113","type":"group","x":0,"y":760,"width":2060,"height":300,"label":"Token / JWT SSO：前端携带，后端验签","color":"6"},
		{"id":"1111111111111114","type":"group","x":0,"y":1140,"width":2060,"height":330,"label":"双 Token 模式：被动拦截与主动预测","color":"6"},
		{"id":"1111111111111115","type":"group","x":0,"y":1560,"width":1600,"height":330,"label":"Vue 项目状态恢复","color":"5"},
		{"id":"1111111111111116","type":"group","x":1660,"y":1560,"width":620,"height":330,"label":"路由守卫触发","color":"3"},
		{"id":"1111111111111117","type":"group","x":0,"y":1980,"width":2060,"height":360,"label":"Key / Difficult Points","color":"1"},
		{"id":"2100000000000001","type":"text","x":80,"y":90,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"3","text":"## HTTP 无状态\n\n每次请求天然互不认识，所以必须找一个载体保存登录态或身份凭证。"},
		{"id":"2100000000000002","type":"text","x":500,"y":70,"width":330,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"## 浏览器存储载体\n\n- Cookie：可被浏览器自动携带\n- localStorage：前端 JS 手动读取\n- sessionStorage：标签页级临时状态"},
		{"id":"2100000000000003","type":"text","x":980,"y":70,"width":350,"height":160,"color":"6","text":"## 认证机制\n\n- Session：服务端保存真实登录态\n- Token / JWT：客户端持有凭证，服务端验签\n- 双 Token：短 token 访问，长 token 刷新"},
		{"id":"2100000000000004","type":"text","x":1460,"y":90,"width":240,"height":120,"color":"5","text":"## 受保护资源\n\n验证通过后，子系统返回业务数据。"},
		{"id":"2200000000000001","type":"text","x":80,"y":470,"width":230,"height":110,"color":"5","text":"## 用户 / 浏览器\n\n触发登录，并在后续访问子系统。"},
		{"id":"2200000000000002","type":"text","x":390,"y":470,"width":270,"height":110,"color":"6","text":"## 认证中心 `/auth/login`\n\n校验用户名密码，生成 sid。"},
		{"id":"2200000000000003","type":"text","x":740,"y":430,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"4","text":"## Cookie: sid\n\n客户端会话凭证。浏览器会在满足条件时自动携带。"},
		{"id":"2200000000000004","type":"text","x":740,"y":560,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"6","text":"## Session 存储\n\n真实登录态在服务端：`sid -> user`。"},
		{"id":"2200000000000005","type":"text","x":1080,"y":470,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"5","text":"## 子系统 A / B\n\n同主域或正确凭证配置下，接收请求并读取 sid，再找认证中心验证。"},
		{"id":"2200000000000006","type":"text","x":1410,"y":470,"width":270,"height":110,"color":"6","text":"## 认证中心 `/auth/verify`\n\n查询 Session，返回 `valid/user`。"},
		{"id":"2200000000000007","type":"text","x":1770,"y":470,"width":230,"height":110,"color":"5","text":"## 受保护资源\n\n验证通过后返回资源。访问 B 时无需再次登录。"},
		{"id":"2200000000000008","type":"text","x":1080,"y":600,"width":600,"height":70,"color":"1","text":"## 跨主域限制\n\n`auth.com` 和 `app-a.com` 不能天然共享 Cookie。SSO 常用重定向 Ticket/Token 后各域写 Cookie，或配合 X-CSRF、`withCredentials` / CORS 凭证配置。"},
		{"id":"2300000000000001","type":"text","x":80,"y":850,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"5","text":"## 前端 `login()`\n\n提交用户名密码，等待认证中心返回 token。"},
		{"id":"2300000000000002","type":"text","x":400,"y":850,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"6","text":"## 认证中心 `/login`\n\n签名生成 JWT。"},
		{"id":"2300000000000003","type":"text","x":730,"y":850,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"1","text":"## JWT\n\n`header.payload.signature`，客户端持有，资源服务验签。"},
		{"id":"2300000000000004","type":"text","x":1070,"y":850,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"4","text":"## localStorage: token\n\n前端保存 token。请求前必须手动读取。"},
		{"id":"2300000000000005","type":"text","x":1410,"y":850,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"5","text":"## axios / fetch 请求层\n\n把 token 注入 `Authorization`。"},
		{"id":"2300000000000006","type":"text","x":1750,"y":850,"width":260,"height":110,"color":"5","text":"## 后端子系统 `jwt.verify`\n\n这是后端行为：后端用 Secret 或公钥验签、检查过期，成功后返回资源。前端不应该持有签名密钥，最多用 `jwt-decode` 解析 payload 做展示或过期提示。"},
		{"id":"2400000000000001","type":"text","x":80,"y":1230,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"1","text":"## Access Token\n\n短有效期，主要用于高频访问资源。"},
		{"id":"2400000000000002","type":"text","x":400,"y":1230,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"5","text":"## 子系统资源服务\n\n本地验签，检查 Access Token 是否过期。"},
		{"id":"2400000000000003","type":"text","x":720,"y":1230,"width":260,"height":110,"color":"3","text":"## Access 状态判断\n\n两种触发方式：\n- 被动拦截：后端返回 401 后刷新。\n- 主动预测：请求前发现快过期，先刷新再请求。"},
		{"id":"2400000000000004","type":"text","x":720,"y":1360,"width":260,"height":90,"color":"2","text":"## Refresh Token\n\n长有效期，有状态，可吊销。"},
		{"id":"2400000000000005","type":"text","x":1060,"y":1230,"width":260,"height":110,"color":"6","text":"## 认证中心 `/refresh`\n\n只处理刷新，不直接访问业务资源。调用者通常是响应拦截器或请求拦截器。"},
		{"id":"2400000000000006","type":"text","x":1400,"y":1230,"width":260,"height":110,"color":"6","text":"## Refresh 状态存储\n\n记录归属用户、是否吊销、是否轮换。"},
		{"id":"2400000000000007","type":"text","x":1760,"y":1230,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"3","text":"## Refresh 是否有效\n\n有效：签发新 Access Token。\n无效：要求重新登录。"},
		{"id":"2400000000000008","type":"text","x":1060,"y":1360,"width":260,"height":90,"color":"5","text":"## 被动拦截：无感刷新\n\n请求资源 -> 后端返回 401 -> 响应拦截器挂起原请求 -> 刷新 token -> 重放原请求。"},
		{"id":"2400000000000009","type":"text","x":1400,"y":1360,"width":260,"height":90,"color":"5","text":"## 主动预测：提前刷新\n\n请求拦截器判断 Access Token 快过期，例如剩 1 分钟，先刷新，再发送业务请求。"},
		{"id":"2500000000000001","type":"text","x":80,"y":1650,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"5","text":"## `createApp(App)`\n\n应用启动入口。"},
		{"id":"2500000000000002","type":"text","x":390,"y":1650,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"5","text":"## `createPinia()`\n\n创建状态容器。"},
		{"id":"2500000000000003","type":"text","x":700,"y":1650,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"6","text":"## `useCartStore`\n\n真实业务状态持有者：`cartList`、`selectedIds`、`remark`。"},
		{"id":"2500000000000004","type":"text","x":1030,"y":1650,"width":230,"height":110,"color":"5","text":"## `loadState()`\n\n初始化读取缓存。"},
		{"id":"2500000000000005","type":"text","x":1340,"y":1650,"width":240,"height":110,"color":"4","text":"## `localStorage: cart-store`\n\n刷新恢复，变更写回；不是业务逻辑中心。"},
		{"id":"2500000000000006","type":"text","x":700,"y":1780,"width":250,"height":90,"color":"5","text":"## store actions\n\n`addCart/removeCart/updateRemark/clearCart` 更新 store。"},
		{"id":"2500000000000007","type":"text","x":1030,"y":1780,"width":230,"height":90,"color":"5","text":"## `$subscribe`\n\nstore 变更后同步写入 localStorage。"},
		{"id":"2600000000000001","type":"text","x":1730,"y":1650,"width":240,"height":90,"color":"3","text":"## URL 变化\n\n全局守卫一定触发。"},
		{"id":"2600000000000002","type":"text","x":1730,"y":1780,"width":240,"height":90,"color":"3","text":"## 是否复用组件实例\n\n复用走 `beforeRouteUpdate`；新建走 `beforeRouteEnter`。"},
		{"id":"2700000000000001","type":"text","x":80,"y":2070,"width":390,"height":150,"color":"1","text":"## Difficult Point: 自动携带 vs 手动携带\n\nCookie 最大特点是浏览器自动携带；localStorage / token 必须由请求层手动读取并放入请求头。"},
		{"id":"2700000000000002","type":"text","x":560,"y":2070,"width":390,"height":150,"color":"1","text":"## Difficult Point: 真实状态持有者\n\nSession 真实登录态在服务端；JWT 真实凭证在客户端；Pinia store 才是 Vue 业务状态持有者。"},
		{"id":"2700000000000003","type":"text","x":1040,"y":2070,"width":390,"height":150,"color":"1","text":"## Difficult Point: 双 Token 的职责拆分\n\nAccess Token 走资源服务；Refresh Token 只走认证中心。不要把长 token 当作普通资源访问凭证。"},
		{"id":"2700000000000004","type":"text","x":1520,"y":2070,"width":390,"height":150,"color":"1","text":"## Difficult Point: Vue 缓存恢复\n\nlocalStorage 只负责恢复和持久化。业务修改应先进入 store action，再由订阅同步写回。"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"f100000000000001","fromNode":"2100000000000001","fromSide":"right","toNode":"2100000000000002","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"需要状态载体"},
		{"id":"f100000000000002","fromNode":"2100000000000002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"2100000000000003","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"构建认证机制"},
